{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01624","headline":"杂曲歌辞 伤歌行 · 庄南杰","name":"杂曲歌辞 伤歌行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兔走鸟飞不相见，人事依稀速如电。\n王母夭桃一度开，玉楼红粉千回变。\n车驰马走咸阳道，石家旧宅空荒草。\n秋雨无情不惜花，芙蓉一一惊香倒。\n劝君莫谩栽荆棘，秦皇虚费驱山力。\n英风一去更无言，白骨沈埋暮山碧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庄南杰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01624.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01624","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}